window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What if courage was your only option? </p> <p>With her mother now a Blue, her friends kidnapped, and Petra for an enemy, Kallie's pretty sure things have gone as badly as they could go. </p> <p>Unfortunately, she's wrong - things are about to get a whole lot worse. If she ever wants to see her family reunited, she's going to have to rely on the one person she most wants to see destroyed: Petra. </p> <p>In a race against time and the enmity of the Rogue Reds, Kallie and Petra must seek out an artifact that can undo the damage of the vampires' faction war. As Petra seeks to turn Kallie to her side, Kallie must weigh whether she's right to place any trust in her birth mother, and if she must, is it worth losing her allies and the ones she loves? </p>"; 
